		{
			dependencies: [
				"028B0660FD4BDF35"
			]
			description: [
				"Aluminium supports spin to 512 RPM with no drag, and aluminium never weathers. The catch: its shafts and cogs carry only light loads, and it melts beside anything &6Hot&r, from lava and fire to a lit Furnace, a Blaze Burner or molten metal. A melted part runs down and sets as rough aluminium."
				""
				"Its pipes take only &eWarm&r fluids and its tanks make no boiler. Keep it well away from the furnace yard."
				""
				"Every aluminium bracket and casing needs a Polyethylene Bushing, so aluminium parts wait for the Steel Furnace chapter."
			]
			id: "44DB9B8C2FC1DCE2"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Steel's speed, no drag, and a weakness"
